  "pli-tv-kd3:1.3.4": "<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Vassaṁ upagantuṁ</i>, literally, “to enter the rainy season”, but the idea of staying put in one place is implied. In these cases <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vassa</i>, “rainy season”, is used synonymously with <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vassāvāsa</i>, “rainy-season residence” or “rains residence”. ",
